    "identifier": "bladed-chakra-scalpel",
    "description": "<p>Beginning at 5th level, you have learned to manifest a medical ninja’s signature combat technique, the Chakra Scalpel.</p>\n<p>As a Bonus Action, you can coat your hands in highly condensed blades of blue Chakra, designed to slice with surgical efficiency. For the next minute, when you take the attack action, you can replace those attacks with a Melee Ninjutsu Attack. These attacks are treated as a Ninjutsu with the medical keyword of the highest rank you can cast, based on your level. This attack deals 1d8 + your Channeled Healing bonus as Slashing damage.</p>",
